@prefix ex:   <https://example.org/logic#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<https://example.org/logic> a owl:Ontology .
ex:Cat a owl:Class . ex:Dog a owl:Class . ex:Pet a owl:Class .
ex:Cat rdfs:subClassOf ex:Pet . ex:Dog rdfs:subClassOf ex:Pet .
ex:Cat owl:disjointWith ex:Dog .
ex:Impossible a owl:Class ; owl:equivalentClass owl:Nothing .
ex:mother a owl:ObjectProperty , owl:FunctionalProperty .
ex:hates a owl:ObjectProperty , owl:IrreflexiveProperty .
ex:Puppy a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ex:Dog .
